You can follow us on Twitter at artseducators.
你可以在 Twitter 上关注我们，账号是 artseducators。

00:41:38.280 --> 00:41:40.119
Yes, somehow that wasn't taken yet.
是的，不知怎么的，这个名字当时还没被注册。

00:41:40.119 --> 00:41:43.519
and on Instagram at artseducatorspodcast.
也可以在 Instagram 上关注我们，账号是 artseducatorspodcast。

00:41:43.519 --> 00:41:49.000
Write to us with your questions and comments at contact at artseducatorspodcast.com.
请将你的问题和意见发送至 contact at artseducatorspodcast.com 与我们联系。

00:41:49.000 --> 00:41:52.960
And wherever you're listening, please remember to subscribe, rate, and review.
无论你在哪里收听，请记得订阅、评分和写评论。

00:41:52.960 --> 00:41:54.320
It really helps the show.
这真的对节目很有帮助。

